      "id": 160396,
      "name": "Season 1",
      "overview": "As new veterinarian James Herriot gets to know his new family at Skeldale House\u2014his erratic boss Siegfried Farnon, his wayward brother Tristan and the shrewd housekeeper Mrs Hall\u2014he is also drawn to local farmer\u2019s daughter Helen Alderson.",
